478
00:36:35,400 --> 00:36:41,140
And work with mounting density as tight as possible, so we don't have big distances between parts.

479
00:36:42,160 --> 00:36:43,900
They're practically all next to each other.

480
00:36:47,670 --> 00:36:50,650
The diode bridge doesn't matter how you make it.

481
00:36:51,870 --> 00:36:52,870
