00:37:31,430 --> 00:37:36,770
If more than 50W, you can position the heat sink, so it sticks out of the box for cooling.

489
00:37:38,210 --> 00:37:41,150
The heat sink dimensions are 6 centimeters in length.

490
00:37:46,710 --> 00:37:49,290
With practically 3.5 centimeters.

